@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_TEST_TOKEN

# Target examples; routes are learner work and UUIDs must be replaced.

### Register a member (save the id from the response)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/members
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"ada@example.com","displayName":"Ada"}

### Create a book
POST {{base}}/api/v1/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"isbn":"9780134685991","title":"Effective Java","authors":["Joshua Bloch"]}

### List with a bounded page
GET {{base}}/api/v1/books?page=0&size=20

### Borrow (replace the UUIDs with your created member and copy)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{"memberId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","copyId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"}
